          {
            "title": "Descriptive names",
            "id": 87014,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dare alle funzioni nomi descrittivi come <code>get_final_price</code> ci aiuta a capire a colpo d'occhio cosa fanno.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_final_price\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price, tax)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price + tax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"price = get_final_price(\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"price\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"31.5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>get_final_price</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I nomi descrittivi aiutano a capire cosa fa una funzione.</p><p>Assegna a questa funzione un nome che descriva il calcolo del prezzo finale e usa lo stesso nome nella sua chiamata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_final_price\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(price, tax)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price + tax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"price = get_final_price(\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(price)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"price\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"31.5\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>get_final_price</code>, seguito da <code>get_final_price</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Verb",
            "id": 87015,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni sono azioni, quindi il loro nome spesso inizia con un verbo, come in questo caso con <code>create</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"create_email\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name + \" /><text value=\"&quot;@hutmail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"email = create_email(\" /><text value=\"&quot;jo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(email)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"10\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"jo@hutmail.com\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>create</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Functions that return values",
            "id": 87017,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni che restituiscono valori spesso iniziano con verbi come <code>get</code>, come in <code>get_telephone</code>, <code>compute</code> o <code>calculate</code>, come in <code>calculate_sum</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_telephone\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(prefix, number)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prefix + number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_sum\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num_1 + num_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>get</code>, seguito da <code>calculate</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Function that returns booleans",
            "id": 87018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come caso particolare, le funzioni che restituiscono valori booleani spesso iniziano con <code>is</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"is_freezing\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(temperature)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"freezing = is_freezing(\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(freezing)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>is</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni che restituiscono valori booleani spesso iniziano con <code>is</code>.</p><p>Segui questa convenzione di denominazione e scegli una temperatura che faccia stampare al codice <code>True</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"is_freezing\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(temperature)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperature &lt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"freezing = is_freezing(\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(freezing)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"True\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>is</code>, seguito da <code>-3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Same naming practice",
            "id": 87019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La chiave è mantenere la stessa convenzione di denominazione per le funzioni che svolgono un compito simile, come <code>calculate_sum</code> e <code>calculate_difference</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_sum\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num_1 + num_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_difference\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num_1 - num_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>calculate</code>, seguito da <code>calculate</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mantieni la stessa convenzione di denominazione per le funzioni che svolgono compiti simili.</p><p>Usa il prefisso <code>calculate</code> per entrambi i nomi e associa ogni nome al calcolo che svolge.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_sum\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num_1 + num_2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_difference\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1, num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" num_1 - num_2\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_sum\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get_difference\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>calculate_sum</code>, seguito da <code>calculate_difference</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Descriptive names",
            "id": 87020,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché è importante assegnare alle funzioni nomi descrittivi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Per sapere a colpo d'occhio cosa fa la funzione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Per evitare di ricevere un errore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Per sapere a colpo d'occhio cosa fa la funzione.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I nomi descrittivi ci permettono di capire a colpo d'occhio che cosa fa una funzione.</p><p>Sia <code>send_email()</code> sia <code>task()</code> funzionano senza errori. Perché <code>send_email()</code> è più chiaro?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Descrive lo scopo della funzione senza leggerne il corpo.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python rifiuta i nomi di funzione che non ne descrivono lo scopo.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">I nomi di funzione più lunghi rendono sempre più veloce l'esecuzione.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Descrive lo scopo della funzione senza leggerne il corpo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Verb",
            "id": 87021,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con cosa iniziano di solito i nomi delle funzioni?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Verbi come <code>create</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nome come <code>first_name</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Verbi come <code>create</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I nomi delle funzioni iniziano generalmente con verbi, come <code>create</code>.</p><p>Quale nome è più adatto a una funzione che crea un report?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>create_report()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>report()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>first_report()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>create_report()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Functions that return values",
            "id": 87023,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con quali verbi potrebbero iniziare le funzioni che restituiscono valori?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>compute</code>, <code>calculate</code>, <code>get</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>has</code>, <code>is</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>compute</code>, <code>calculate</code>, <code>get</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni che restituiscono valori iniziano spesso con verbi come <code>compute</code>, <code>calculate</code> o <code>get</code>.</p><p>Quale nome si addice meglio a una funzione che calcola e restituisce il totale di un ordine?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>calculate_total()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>is_total()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>total()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>calculate_total()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Function that returns booleans",
            "id": 87024,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con quali verbi potrebbero iniziare le funzioni che restituiscono valori booleani?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>is</code>, <code>has</code>, <code>can</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get</code>, <code>make</code>, <code>calculate</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>is</code>, <code>has</code>, <code>can</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Le funzioni che restituiscono booleani iniziano spesso con <code>is</code>, <code>has</code> o <code>can</code>.</p><p>Quale nome si addice meglio a una funzione che restituisce se un utente ha accesso?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>has_access()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_access()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>calculate_access()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>has_access()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Same naming practice",
            "id": 87025,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa significa mantenere lo stesso nome della funzione?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Usare lo stesso verbo per le funzioni che eseguono attività simili</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usare lo stesso verbo indipendentemente da ciò che fanno le funzioni</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Usare lo stesso verbo per le funzioni che eseguono attività simili.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una denominazione coerente usa lo stesso verbo per funzioni che svolgono attività simili.</p><p>Un progetto contiene <code>load_profile()</code>. Quale nome è più adatto a una funzione simile che carica le impostazioni?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>load_settings()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_settings()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>settings_load()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>load_settings()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Descriptive names",
            "id": 87026,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dai a questa funzione un nome descrittivo che mostri un articolo e il suo prezzo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_item_price\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item, price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{item}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\": $\" /><text value=\"{price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display_item_price(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_item\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"chocolate: $3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>display_item_price</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La funzione mostra un articolo e il suo prezzo. Assegnale un nome che menzioni entrambi e chiamala così. Stampa <code>chocolate: $3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"display_item_price\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item, price)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{item}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\": $\" /><text value=\"{price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"display_item_price(\" /><text value=\"&quot;chocolate&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"display_item\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"chocolate: $3\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>display_item_price</code>, seguito da <code>display_item_price</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Verb",
            "id": 87027,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assicurati che il nome di questa funzione inizi con un verbo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"generate_username\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name, b_day)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"_\" /><text value=\"{b_day}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user = generate_username(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"ty_17\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>generate</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Il nome di questa funzione deve iniziare con un verbo. Usa lo stesso prefisso nella chiamata. Stampa <code>ty_17</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"generate_username\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(name, b_day)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"_\" /><text value=\"{b_day}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"user = generate_username(\" /><text value=\"&quot;ty&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(user)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"user\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"ty_17\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>generate</code>, seguito da <code>generate</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Functions that return values",
            "id": 87032,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scrivi un nome per questa funzione che calcola i posti liberi rimasti a uno spettacolo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_free_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(booked, total)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - booked\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"free = get_free_seats(\" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(free)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"has_free_seats\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>get_free_seats</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il nome descrittivo della funzione e scegli i posti prenotati in modo che il codice stampi <code>7</code> posti liberi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_free_seats\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(booked, total)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total - booked\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"free = get_free_seats(\" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(free)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"get_booked_seats\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"7\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>get_free_seats</code>, seguito da <code>13</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Same naming practice",
            "id": 87034,
